{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"86154171a42253d9f6e259f96c6cc64814850e64dda8fe809d5631c3029e20d2","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"872c42cace6505938ad1d2d28699096ceb28e3748019da890b7a32a2b53f0d38","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8739dec0e2c6141198f4a935aa3fc12158907b1fea57ebb2c635b601df43abdc","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"873dc533e8f1b45754416471f14dc381faf23c7cfedd7f61b8ec3c14a3b45f4d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"875625e2cb2f063322c7beddcf7eec7f503357d9854017c1c1f6b9368624a392","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8756f803d92e455944149229ddf3b993e6b61742bfc9357110fe2763b5921680","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"876595e7817619185db9671b26024c745067bae624133e9348bf0567e69187fa","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8767ea25ebfec552e761c2f65ebb9e78984b2908e8d8e2fe9985bb89cdbebcc9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"876ac2082fae3b972b77eaebe97db541a81c3ab3b7bcd753d0b7634dbea0c17b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"876fedc898f23dac1ef7ef199a63ae4f26a89e5f1d26825de9da213503b2f7b5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8770f1fa94f9f01c6959987a81ff69abdb8a41335ce65dea91ea3b66557fe63a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8773e198c26dc9ede2868475396756250d8f02b702f06c6861a5bda45f096c08","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"87c17733b5a2fcae6498a95feebeea7b0ec87c67172e320e844542133caef6ac","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"术语/语义错误：源文 \"broken by the paradox\" 中 the paradox 指本次「被未来的自己杀死」所造成的时空悖论这一具名机制，译文作「时间流被混乱所打破」把 paradox 换成了「混乱」，既丢失悖论含义，也与时空法师资源/职业名不一致。补查：组件 tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/quests/paradoxology.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63；关键调用 a.on_kill 分支 108-117 行：第 109 行 p:setQuestStatus(\"paradoxology\", ...)，第 110 行即本条日志，第 112 行 game:setAllowedBuild(\"chronomancer_paradox_mage\", true)，第 113 行 world:gainAchievement(\"PARADOX_NOW\", p)，第 116 行 rift.change_level_check 文本 \"This rift in time has been created by the paradox.\"——同一 the paradox 被反复指代为具体事件而非泛指的混乱。"},{"revision_key":"87d03c62e312c12f6228d413ddb243d68a625e5fa13c95837137d69a1fb1a070","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制信息漏译：源文第 3 句 \"The bonus scales with your Spellpower and talent level.\" 含两个成长因子，译文「受法术强度影响，增益按比例加成。」只保留法术强度，漏掉技能等级。补查：组件 tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/magical-combat.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63；info 函数 240-248 行，第 243 行为该句；第 239 行 getSPMult = function(self, t) return self:combatTalentScale(t, 1/7, 5/7) end 与第 248 行 tformat(t.getSPMult(self, t)*100, self:getMag() * t.getSPMult(self, t), ...) 证明物理强度加成系数确实随技能等级 scale，技能等级不是可省略的修饰。"},{"revision_key":"87f414f0dd69bbd8cb9f6aeac9083dd9b6b9ee7dc5980cf2703df9cf8d569e7f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"87f50c36c5aa514fbd10608717e7fd1d9b24d972ea653ead79ad55d122156c80","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8810841f39654250571db30c2c3c5802d667b986ac0eab9b76306002133a7088","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"883d9b5a38256d3668b13e266494da74374138c565d04f1729e8427741498c5c","verdict":"OK"}]}